      ],
      "text": "@rauchg System refactors used to be months or years long projects. Now they can be done in a matter of weeks. Will be interesting to see what the second order effects are from this for performance and reliability, now that adapting a new language doesn't have the same amount of friction.",
      "url": "https://x.com/jambronner/status/2120563394659107121"
    },
