      ],
      "text": "@rauchg If an agent drops from Rust to C or LLVM IR for a hot path, I'd keep a reference implementation and differential-test outputs across optimization levels. A speedup that depends on undefined behavior can pass one build and disappear in the next.",
      "url": "https://x.com/renandnzsantos/status/2120557124790923715"
    },
    {
      "author_id": "2090262197792645120",
